                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/releases/tag/0.53.1"&gt;0.53.1 (hotfix)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This is a hotfix release for 0.53.0, which accidentally included &lt;code&gt;OpenCli.Sources&lt;/code&gt; as a dependency, instead of being included in the package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a bonus, a fix for panels was also included in this release 😄&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure OpenCli.Sources are not a dependency of the CLI package. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/patriksvensson/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/patriksvensson"&gt;@patriksvensson&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/commit/d61788d6c681745c8d1158ceeb4545ba37a99522/hovercard" href="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/commit/d61788d6c681745c8d1158ceeb4545ba37a99522"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;d61788d&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Normalizes paths when writing exceptions to the console for tests. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/phil-scott-78/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/phil-scott-78"&gt;@phil-scott-78&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2844098893" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/issues/1758" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/spectreconsole/spectre.console/pull/1758/hovercard" href="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/pull/1758"&gt;#1758&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixes issue with Panel not applying overflow to children by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/phil-scott-78/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/phil-scott-78"&gt;@phil-scott-78&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3575500765" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/issues/1942" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/spectreconsole/spectre.console/pull/1942/hovercard" href="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/pull/1942"&gt;#1942&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
